  "goodToKnow": "Eisern means made of iron (ein eisernes Tor) or figuratively iron-hard: ein eiserner Wille, eiserne Disziplin. Der Eiserne Vorhang was the Iron Curtain. Otto von Bismarck was called der Eiserne Kanzler. As an adverb, eisern means resolutely: eisern sparen (to save with iron discipline). Die eiserne Hochzeit is the 65th wedding anniversary. Das Eiserne Kreuz (Iron Cross) is the emblem of the Bundeswehr. From das Eisen (iron)."
